# The build context for every image is the repository root. Secrets, personal files, caches and tests never enter an
# image (12/N10, 07/O1): the image content test (tests/image/) fails if any of them does.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/.dev-keys
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/state
.git
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.hypothesis
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.uploads
apps/api/tests
apps/web/tests
tests
docs
ops
**/.DS_Store
